meta {
  name: Competitions (all)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{newBase}}/competitions
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  The unfiltered archive — ~8000 competitions, ~875 KB. This is what
  `SyncLiveCompetitionsJob` fetches on every run today.

  Note what is *missing* here: `country`, `hasResults`, `multiDayStage` and
  `multiDayFirstDay` only appear on the filtered variants below.

  In the plan this call survives only in the nightly stale-competition purge, which
  needs the full id set to know what has been deleted upstream.
}
